{"version":1,"content":"<p>踏入深秋，中國多地被銀杏樹披上金裝。</p><p>河北省邯鄲市曲周縣及石家莊市、北京國家植物園，以及遼寧丹東百年銀杏大道銀杏樹林，近日迎來最佳觀賞期，吸引大批遊客前來賞景及打卡留念。</p><p>（新華社）</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T06:25:16.119746+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":91,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T06:14:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T14:38:20.980400+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T06:18:22.942893+00:00","content_hash":"dd119ef6ef777e7399bb7c1db1676de7731903263cdb6dbe36de8eb87b8e691a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}